We have described how to maintain the independent sets $S_1,\ldots ,S_8$ satisfying invariants~\ref{inv:1}--\ref{inv:5} in polylogarithmic expected amortized update time. By Lemma~\ref{lem:invariants}, the largest of $S_1,\ldots , S_8$ is a constant-factor approximate MIS of $\mathcal{D}$. For each dynamic update in $\mathcal{D}$ can add or remove $O(1)$ disks in $S_k$, for some $k\in \{1,\ldots, 8\}$, by Lemmata~\ref{lem:insert-time}--\ref{lem:delete-time}. 
